{"server":"en","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-01_beg","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-01","title":"Isolated Island","storyCode":"1-1","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"50c23a29cb4f979f8f6c80f602f8d7c7f4ac051e1dc9277b24a32a22ec341951","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第七关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Is it just me, or is the sky getting darker?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"...If only it was just you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"We never had much time anyway."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_9_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"The shape of the Catastrophe cloud is more clearly defined than the black haze it was before."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Tsk. I don't like the feeling I get from watching it form over our heads. What a bad omen."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"To make things worse, Reunion goons might be lurking in every nook and cranny."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Actually, that's probably too conservative."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"What you should've said is that they're probably partying on the streets."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Almost every street is filled with destruction, violence and looting. Vehicles and buildings are being set on fire..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"But these thugs decide that it's the perfect weather for a picnic!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"If they're going out on a picnic now, it's the Catastrophe that will feast upon their bones."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"This proves that most Reunion members are just fools who've been whipped into a frenzy."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Pfft."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Look, they're not really having a picnic..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"I, I just wanted something to moan about. You didn't have to take me so seriously..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, you weren't being serious？Wait, were you trying to crack a joke?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry, I'm not good with this stuff..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Umm... It's fine..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"It's just that... trying not to laugh is hard..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Um, sorry... for trying to make a joke at such a serious time..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's okay."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island wasn't founded for the sake of having everyone keep a serious face."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We've always wanted everyone to be able to smile."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"A-Amiya..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry about it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"In any case, let's help out with the scouting."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll quietly dispatch the enemy at our four o'clock."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Hopefully their diseased organs won't explode or be rigged to serve as some kind of alarm."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll wrap around and take care of the large group on the other side of the fortification."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"With this much chaos around us, nobody will notice a little more noise."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"All right, let's move out!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["Guard"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["Medic"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["Dobermann"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["Nearl"]}]}
